    <string name="privacy_data_collection">The app collects a minimal set of data needed for game statistics: time, errors, and game results. Data is linked to an anonymous device ID and contains no personal information.</string>
    <string name="privacy_data_usage">Collected data is used exclusively for:\n• Displaying your game statistics\n• Calculating your percentile among other players\nData is not shared with third parties or used for advertising.</string>
    <string name="privacy_data_storage">Game statistics are stored locally and synced with Firebase Realtime Database for the player comparison feature. You can delete your data at any time via Settings → Reset statistics.</string>
    <string name="privacy_user_rights">You have the right to:\n• Delete all your data via app settings\n• Disable statistics sync\n• Request server data deletion by contacting the developer</string>
